ungen sind hochgradig anpassbar und k\u00f6nnen f\u00fcr eigene Projekte genutzt werden.", "short_description": "Artivact ist ein kostenloses, quelloffenes Werkzeug zur Sammlungsverwaltung und -pr\u00e4sentation.\nMit Artivact XR kannst du diese Sammlungen in der virtuellen Realit\u00e4t erleben."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "quest_portrait.png", "id": "4209759382644599", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393841_4209759385977932_3266183942185304833_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qTpeFAww7ukQ7kNvwG5Zukd&_nc_oc=AdrSut4cPhgDDs_HjCiMPt9UxA0dLtoIMbYbjydSCM0cR7cBJBsV4exb6f2hcgmj4Dg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQjgxbywOnNbu4i-htXlfFXdrlg5_Ulsg5chAB3S1QPIA&oe=6B01EF3C"}, {"file_name": "quest_hero_cover.png", "id": "1263316755151138", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499292244_1263316758484471_159357681156275043_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=eGGSHujSChcQ7kNvwGO9MWe&_nc_oc=AdrM7KoSw19TDlTqRaDAJ8OjM6QDNNDwSK5k96v43NAQvwaai-3knsOJmI0oo_Swuew&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS26eTw0_kHiLCI5OVz_mG9JwkUtKYzzMlSix4HaY6gIQ&oe=6B01D356"}, {"file_name": "quest_landscape.png", "id": "1039024501005104", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393450_1039024504338437_7487200977707356540_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bS3WDdckErMQ7kNvwF19v69&_nc_oc=Adrm-2UqX4Vk4MfDRsbjV6PxwH5-RBf4rst_Qb3x4t8wmLE9RO_TwzefHWfxmpByRhU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSh3PyeFIAJckQkjvZr0FOkg6jRKLH-MmQw4-25UiEbRg&oe=6B01E124"}, {"file_name": "quest_logo.png", "id": "707346191636121", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.577